<title>FINLAND: Nokia's Hintikka goes to Hackman.</title>
<headline>Nokia's Hintikka goes to Hackman.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said on Monday that group executive board member Tapio Hintikka, president of Nokia's General Communications Products division, will resign and become managing of Oy Hackman Ab on January 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
